### FilmFuse core-api - personal "For you". Token: see me.http.
# Ranked by python-ml-service from your vector (or popularity until you have one / when it is down),
# within movies that pass your comfort settings, never anything you rated, skipped or dismissed.
# Cached per vector version; a rebuild refreshes it.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### First page (20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Next page: pass nextCursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/recommendations?cursor=paste-next-cursor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Not interested (204, idempotent; a weak negative taste signal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/recommendations/550/dismiss
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recalibrate: next swipe posters (count 1-30, default 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/calibration/next
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
